
§ `Test file for AND/OR depth linter warning`
    GIVEN a IS BOOLEAN
          b IS BOOLEAN
          c IS BOOLEAN
          d IS BOOLEAN
          e IS BOOLEAN

-- This SHOULD trigger a warning: AND and OR at same indentation (column 5)
DECIDE `mixed at same level`
IF  a
    AND b
    OR c

-- This should NOT trigger a warning: properly nested
DECIDE `properly nested`
IF  a
    AND b
    AND (c OR d)

-- This should NOT trigger a warning: all ANDs at same level
DECIDE `all ands`
IF  a
    AND b
    AND c
    AND d

-- This should NOT trigger a warning: all ORs at same level
DECIDE `all ors`
IF  a
    OR b
    OR c
    OR d

-- This should NOT trigger: ORs are indented further than ANDs
DECIDE `ors indented more`
IF  a
    AND b
    AND c
        OR d
        OR e
